hat $f(x)=y.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, $f$ is a surjection of $R$ onto $R.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362505 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362506 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362507 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362508 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362509 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362505 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362504 1080 #uuid "e4a8656d-1a39-53f0-8a58-a8098512d0fa" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362505 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362505 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362505 1084 #uuid "7fea23d2-363a-57c8-82a0-74159786da57" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362506 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362506 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362506 1084 #uuid "bb9d68c7-8aae-5030-aeee-be7bbf76aaaf" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362507 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362507 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362507 1084 #uuid "03327d8a-67bc-51b0-aad8-0860846d9ed3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362508 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362508 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362508 1084 #uuid "3f9b7a1e-758c-53b4-8062-27c9d4872fee" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362509 1081 "II only" 13194139533445 1