rac{1}{2}\\notin {1,2,4,8}.$\n\n- II is a surjection. Given $y\\in R,$ choose $x={10}^{y}\\in (0,\\infty ).$ Then $g(x)=g({10}^{y})=\\operatorname{log}⁡{10}^{y}=y.$\n\n- III is a surjection. Indeed, $h(-2)=2,$ $h(-1)=1$ and $h(0)=0.$ So, for every $y\\in {0,1,2},$ there exists an element $x\\in {-2,-1,0,1,2}$ such that $h(x)=y.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362547 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362548 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362549 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362550 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362551 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362547 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362546 1080 #uuid "527f27db-963b-508b-a409-e2056490114b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362547 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362547 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362547 1084 #uuid "78bf5df9-2155-5aaf-90d9-2cd85159ec9d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362548 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362548 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362548 1084 #uuid "3122d473-a840-5c91-9362-bdc5d5e4bb35" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362549 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362549 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362549 1084 #uuid "8636bde8-51b4-59ab-805e-d878f16182c2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362550 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592