gin{aligned}| & | & | & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} & {a}_{4} & {a}_{5} \\\\ | & | & | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{5}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}={x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{1} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{2} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{3} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{4} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{5}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{5} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the image of ${R}^{5}$ under the action of $A$ must be $\\text{Col}(A),$ the column space of $A.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362644 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362645 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362646 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362647 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362648 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362645 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362643 1080 #uuid "f2aaa4ba-aa2b-5c63-98dd-d56973b99ffc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362644 1081 "\\text{Null}(A)" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362644 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362644 1084 #uuid "e7716a75-0eea-5e7d-8387-1aa17c566b26" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362645 1081 "\\text{Col}(A)" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362645 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362645 1084 #uuid "c669296d-1bdf-527a-aa02-77c5f5fc6df1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362646 1081 "{R}^{7}" 13194139533445 17