2186362712 1068 #edb/ref 17592186362713 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362712 1069 "q-114882" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362712 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362712 1071 "${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{{x}^{2}-7x+3}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362712 1072 #uuid "e647ef36-af7e-5b49-8e60-4cebae5f4a39" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362712 1074 "We first need to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder parts, which we can do using synthetic division.\n\nWe draw up a synthetic division table:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{2} & {x}^{1} & {x}^{0} \\\\ 4 & 1 & -7 & 3 \\\\  & ↓ & 4 & -12 \\\\  & 1 & -3 & -9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-7x+3}{x-4}=x-3-\\frac{9}{x-4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{{x}^{2}-7x+3}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(x-3-\\frac{9}{x-4})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}x\\,\\text{d}x-3{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\text{d}x-9{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-3x\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|\\,{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({2}^{2}-{0}^{2})-3(2-0)-9(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2-4|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|0-4|) \\\\  & =2-6-9(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4) \\\\  & =-4+9(\\operatorname{ln}⁡4-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{4}{2})-4 \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362714 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362715 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362716 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362717 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362718 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362713 1076 #edb