ould be the function that generates the vector field above?" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362719 1072 #uuid "74301975-54ad-5b09-8f34-be154a2d8d2e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362719 1074 "We notice the following:\n\n- The horizontal component (i.e., the $i$ component) is negative for *every* vector in our vector field. Therefore, we can rule out the following options:\n\n$$\nG(x,y)=i+j,\\,K(x,y)=x\\,i+j\n$$\n\n- As we move away from the origin in the vertical direction, our vectors' vertical components (i.e., the $j$ components) get longer. Therefore, we can rule out the following option:\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=-i+j\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the diagram corresponds to the vector field $H(x,y)=-2\\,i+y\\,j.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362721 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362722 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362723 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362724 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362725 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362722 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362720 1080 #uuid "37acc21f-bf89-54d6-b6f6-f05fa5abc515" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362721 1081 "K(x,y)=x\\,i+j" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362721 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362721 1084 #uuid "f4da5c52-6b5c-54df-b17f-83bd497bbf4f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362722 1081 "H(x,y)=-2\\,i+y\\,j" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362722 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362722 1084 #uuid "b86e90fc-a436-523b-9da9-b9d702