n by\n\n$$\nS={(x,y,z)\\in {R}^{3}\\,|\\,z\\ne -1,\\,y\\ne 0}\n$$\n\nto a vector in ${R}^{3}.$\n\n- The function $R(t)$ is *not* a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$ It assigns points in $R$ (not ${R}^{3}$) to vectors in ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362763 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362764 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362765 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362766 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362767 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362767 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362762 1080 #uuid "26e476e2-9bb5-503b-95c4-0d2fc7849f6d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362763 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362763 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362763 1084 #uuid "1e1241cb-e0b2-5b46-8f65-a3c4c3647e6b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362764 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362764 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362764 1084 #uuid "81271eb6-6f13-53c5-8aa9-8681bb11bee7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362765 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362765 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362765 1084 #uuid "cd3f72cb-d68f-5920-a038-03163c1fef91" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362766 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362766 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362766 1084 #uuid "2e773405-32c