 of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =1\\cdot f(1)+5\\cdot f(5)+10\\cdot f(10)+15\\cdot f(15)+20\\cdot f(20) \\\\  & =1(\\frac{5}{15})+5(\\frac{4}{15})+10(\\frac{3}{15})+15(\\frac{2}{15})+20(\\frac{1}{15}) \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={1}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{5}^{2}\\cdot f(5)+{10}^{2}\\cdot f(10)+{15}^{2}\\cdot f(15)+{20}^{2}\\cdot f(20) \\\\  & =1(\\frac{5}{15})+25(\\frac{4}{15})+100(\\frac{3}{15})+225(\\frac{2}{15})+400(\\frac{1}{15}) \\\\  & =\\frac{251}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{251}{3}-{7}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{251}{3}-49 \\\\  & =\\frac{251}{3}-\\frac{147}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{104}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362853 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362854 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362855 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362856 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362857 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362854 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1080 #uuid "e692757f-b230-52ff-8ac9-9992151a67f5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362853 1081 "\\frac{100}{3}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362853 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362853 1084 #uuid "0d827289-321c-5d11-a4f5-0a4fb15babf3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362854 1081 "\\frac{1