  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[\\operatorname{sin}⁡u]_{y}^{y+\\pi /4}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(y+\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y]\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(y+\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y]\\text{d}y & ={[\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(y+\\frac{\\pi }{4})]}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}))-(\\operatorname{cos}⁡0-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =(-1+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})-(1-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362888 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362889 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362890 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362891 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362892 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362888 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362887 1080 #uuid "ee0e5c29-c2d5-54e3-854e-db43edf5c5f2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362888 1081 "\\sqrt{2}-2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362888 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362888 1084 #uuid "524f7f14-dc24-511a-a182-79c0fac4f098" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362889 1081 "1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362889 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362889 1084 #uuid "69841359-d8bf-5fe7-9b57-bedf1d929231" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362890 1081 "0" 131941395334