}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2},\\, & \\text{if}\\,-1<x<0,\\,1<y<3, \\\\ 2\\sqrt{xy},\\, & \\text{if}\\,0<x<2,\\,1<y<3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen,\n\n$$\n{∬}_{(-1,2)\\times (1,3)}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362977 1072 #uuid "a774b944-7d72-5689-95c3-4c8773ac78e9" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362977 1074 "First, notice that the rectangle $R$ can be represented as a union of two smaller rectangles, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R & =((-1,0)\\cup (0,2))\\times (1,3) \\\\  & =((-1,0)\\times (1,3))\\cup ((0,2)\\times (1,3)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{(-1,0)\\times (1,3)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (1,3)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{(-1,0)\\times (1,3)}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (1,3)}2\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362979 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362980 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362981 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362982 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362983 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362980 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362978 1080 #uuid "b5eb4a09-10f1-54a8-b196-207ade389828" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362979 1081 "{∬}_{(-1,2)\\times (1,3)}2\\sqrt{xy}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362979 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362979 1084 #uuid "195ede0e-bcb1-56f5-96bd-cca2054972e6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362980 1081 "{∬}_{(-1,0)\\times (1,3)}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (1,3)}2\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362980 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362980 1084 #uuid "18167a5c-451b-51fb-a9ae-5f41b038dbeb" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362981 1081 "{∬}_{(-1,2)\\times (1,2)}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(-1,2)\\times (2,3)}2\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362981 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362981 1084 #uuid "e8ccdbe3-2e9d-5b30-b270-913ee20de1ec" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362982 1081 "{∬}_{(0,1)\\times (1,2)}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (2,3)}2\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362982 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362982 1084 #uuid "42677e57-7a65-5e38-a653-efe44cb86702" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362983 1081 "{∬}_{(-1,2)\\times (1,3)}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+2\\sqrt{xy})\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362983 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362983 1084 #uuid "8b426685-a095-5816-9e16-76c86354887a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1068 #edb/ref 17592186362985 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1069 "q-131501" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1071 "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1072 #uuid "ca4ecbae-990a-5f1f-aeca-c9cba7c7191b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362984 1074 "The system corresponding to $M$ is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+3y-5z=1 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x,y,z$ form a solution of the final two equations $0x+0y+0z=0,$ we can remove these equations from the system. So, our system now consists of just a single equation:\n\n$$\nx+3y-5z=1\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$, and we have two free variables $y$ and $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y,z.$ Doing this, we get\n\n$$\nx=1-3y+5z.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=1-3y+5z \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$, $z$ (free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1-3y+5z \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362986 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362987 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362988 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362989 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362990 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362986 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362985 1080 #uuid "6d7062c0-01e1-52e1-8ed5-92b3891749a7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362986 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362986 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362986 1084 #uuid "752f25aa-4fc1-51e6-a013-9b80e8827572" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362987 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362987 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362987 1084 #uuid "5f33c54b-5751-550c-80ee-312c7a25a862" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362988 1081 "No solution" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362988 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362988 1084 #uuid "bf1a5bfb-1813-5146-9082-83c4984a5e57" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362989 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362989 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362989 1084 #uuid "9ca9b5d9-6498-5036-89e7-97ff59128a90" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362990 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362990 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362990 1084 #uuid "8bd4bf4a-5003-57f0-8acd-836bc85a56e3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362991 1068 #edb/ref 17592186362992 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362991 1069 "q-132117" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362991 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 1319413953344