ting $y=2x+4$ and $y=4-x$ in terms of $y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=2x+4 & \\,⟹\\,x=\\frac{1}{2}y-2 \\\\ y=4-x & \\,⟹\\,x=4-y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine the left and right functions, we draw a horizontal arrow from left to right through the region, as usual.\n\n![](images/da/da7778322523d0d18a5d5e24af075709958d329fc0053c836fd6637aa912752d.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 4,\\,\\frac{1}{2}y-2\\le x\\le 4-y}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}x{e}^{y}\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{y/2-2}^{4-y}x{e}^{y}\\,dx\\,dy\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363063 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363064 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363065 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363066 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363067 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363066 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1080 #uuid "69e509fd-9050-5807-86b8-785ff14d1685" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363063 1081 "{\\int }_{y/2-2}^{4-y}{\\int }_{0}^{4}x{e}^{y}\\,dx\\,dy" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363063 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363063 1084 #uuid "450c3176-72af-509b-9cd2-f6793e13ef73" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363064 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{4-y}^{y/2-2}x{e}^{y}\\,dx\\,dy" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363064 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363064 1084 #uuid "d16e94e9-dff0-56bc-9339-3f32d859713e" 13194139533445 17592186045