(x{y}^{2})\\cdot {y}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(x) \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{tan}⁡(x{y}^{2})+{x}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡(x{y}^{2})\\cdot {y}^{2}\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{tan}⁡(x{y}^{2})+{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡(x{y}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(\\frac{\\pi }{4},1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}{|}_{(\\pi /4,1)} & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\cdot {1}^{2})+{(\\frac{\\pi }{4})}^{2}\\cdot {1}^{2}\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\cdot {1}^{2}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}\\cdot 1+\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{16}\\cdot (\\sqrt{2})^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}+4\\pi }{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363357 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363358 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363359 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363360 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363361 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363358 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363356 1080 #uuid "9a23d4f6-a890-5ca9-9d9c-0ca9c46113c6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363357 1081 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}+2\\pi }{4}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363357 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363357 1084 #uuid "b3c1021c-0885-5bf7-b3e5-6327c277df4c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363358 1081 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}+4\\pi }{8}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363358 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363358 1084 #uuid "110927d7-