186045585 true] [17592186363396 1074 "Recall that the equation of a hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $O$ is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}},\n$$\n\nand a hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is given by\n\n$$\nz-{z}_{0}=\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}},\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a hyperbolic paraboloid with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(1,-1,0),\\,a=5,\\,b=4.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363398 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363399 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363400 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363401 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363402 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363401 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363397 1080 #uuid "ccaa53ca-8518-59e2-bd66-0999b7379505" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363398 1081 "An elliptic cone" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363398 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363398 1084 #uuid "00aba556-f5e9-50ff-88ba-5161e4b75c43" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363399 1081 "An elliptic paraboloid" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363399 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363399 1084 #uuid "457c08f6-2285-59f5-abc9-47a0d044e98f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363400 1081 "An elliptic cylinder" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363400 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363400 1084 #uuid "2c0aa0ac-1910-530f-af19-53795f7f431e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363401 1081 "A hyperbolic paraboloid" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363401 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363401 1084 #uuid "20531269-b480-5010-9e1f-eab50a043abd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363402 1081 "A hyperbolic cylinder" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363402 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363402 1084 #uuid "ec62e2b3-9ba3-5daf-993d-600ff884b9d7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363404 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1069 "q-164511" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1071 "Identify the surface $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{25}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1072 #uuid "4204bbcc-a1ea-508e-b3fb-52f42a2c149f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363403 1074 "Recall that the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThus, an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $y$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis and $a=4,\\,c=5.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363405 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363406 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363407 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363408 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363409 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363406 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363404 1080 #uuid "c433d84b-b68c-545c-b8dc-7d282d4eb95e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363405 1081 "A hyperbolic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363405 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363405 1084 #uuid "2bb526e8-da57-518a-836e-2f345a03dfcd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363406 1081 "An elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363406 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363406 1084 #uuid "4778a235-b8b3-5763-b868-0f8643e9758c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363407 1081 "An elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363407 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363407 1084 #uuid "b38e121f-5a99-5559-b163-8f04aa87b0ad" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363408 1081 "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363408 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363408 1084 #uuid "f182da28-7d76-541b-bd44-0c2982e9b0a4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363409 1081 "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363409 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363409 1084 #uuid "4f6c92b6-7617-5e01-91cd-a264fd7fc4d3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363411 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1069 "q-164517" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1071 "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n4{x}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1,\\,-\\infty <y<\\infty .\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1072 #uuid "254575a6-b38a-59ce-b27e-2f87e3bd1e11" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363410 1074 "Recall that the equation of an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis and $a=\\frac{1}{2},\\,c=1.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363412 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363413 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363414 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363415 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363416 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363413 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363411 1080 #uuid "43c8dfda-6cef-5087-93b4-33239a4ddcbe" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363412 1081 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363412 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363412 1084 #uuid "67c1753a-2ec8-57b6-90b2-f3e9290c36f0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363413 1081 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363413 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363413 1084 #uuid "e59d0521-9453-5d23-9d0b-63fc30e4b04c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363414 1081 "A parabolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363414 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363414 1084 #uuid "7adf68e0-97af-59e9-8764-045285768c7e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363415 1081 "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363415 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363415 1084 #uuid "915c3324-9b00-5d77-b9be-37f4acfd5401" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363416 1081 "A parabolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363416 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363416 1084 #uuid "c4c42182-d493-5d96-aa01-f614facf8bef" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363418 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1069 "q-164551" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1071 "Identify the surface $2{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-4{z}^{2}+4x+8z-10=0.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1072 #uuid "0ee70413-f7e5-5d0a-806c-10db20253a9c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363417 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-4{z}^{2}+4x+8z-10 & =0 \\\\ 2({x}^{2}+2x)+{y}^{2}-4({z}^{2}-2z)-10 & =0 \\\\ 2[(x+1)^{2}-1]+{y}^{2}-4[(z-1)^{2}-1]-10 & =0 \\\\ 2(x+1)^{2}-2+{y}^{2}-4(z-1)^{2}+4-10 & =0 \\\\ 2(x+1)^{2}+{y}^{2}-4(z-1)^{2}-8 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+1)^{2}+{y}^{2}-4(z-1)^{2}-8 & =0 \\\\ 2(x+1)^{2}+{y}^{2}-4(z-1)^{2} & =8 \\\\ \\frac{(x+1)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{2} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-1,0,1).$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363419 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363420 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363421 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363422 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363423 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363419 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363418 1080 #uuid "e941d950-316e-5e7e-8eb1-513344452c65" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363419 1081 "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-1,0,1)$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363419 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363419 1084 #uuid "2d4b7f14-8321-55e3-8547-b5e4dcca9e51" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363420 1081 "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-1,0,-1)$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363420 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363420 1084 #uuid "28f36501-dfe4-5bae-a8dc-97c146169521" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363421 1081 "A hyperboloid of two sheet centered at $(1,0,-1)$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363421 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363421 1084 #uuid "67877beb-bf36-58d4-8b66-f851c5c4483f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363422 1081 "A ellipsoid centered at $(-1,0,1)$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363422 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363422 1084 #uuid "2bf53fd3-9386-5a4c-a79f-f3a6af4d6a45" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363423 1081 "A hyperboloid of two sheets centered at $(-1,0,1)$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363423 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363423 1084 #uuid "0e9ad2a9-9bf4-5355-ae68-2624b7e68903" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363425 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1069 "q-170659" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1071 "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $f:R\\to R$ which is given by $f(x)=(x+1)^{2}-2?$\n\n- The range of $f$ is $[-2,\\infty )$\n- $∀\\,y\\in R,$ $∃\\,x\\in R$ such that $f(x)=y$\n- $f$ is **onto**" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1072 #uuid "97231f8f-64e5-5ea2-a413-41a730985778" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363424 1074 "First, we graph the function.\n\n![](images/9e/9e8457a8caa2f9dbdb627521e23029325f9edda757336a7a5fbbffbda14b4985.png)\n\nA function $f:X\\to Y$ is a surjection (also known as *onto*) if, for *every* element $y$  in $Y,$ there is *at least one* element in $X$ that maps to $y:$ \n\n$f:X\\to Y$ is a surjection if $∀\\,y\\in Y,$ $∃\\,x\\in X$ such that $f(x)=y.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. From the graph, the lowest $y$-value is $-2,$ and it occurs at the point $(-1,-2).$ The graph will cover all $y$-values from $y=-2$ and greater, including the number $-2,$ so the range of the function is $[-2,\\infty ).$\n\n- Statement II is false. Consider $y=-3.$ As we can see from the range, there is no real number $x$ such that $f(x)=-3.$ So, it's *not true* that for all $y$ contained within $R,$ there exists some $x$ contained within $R$ such that $f(x)=y.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, $f$ is not a surjection of $R$ on