rue] [17592186363755 1069 "q-183383" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363755 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363755 1071 "![](images/17/17a493e38294911702a94b8755111db85e7445f03d4d149602b57eebf009f14b.png)\n\nThe shaded regions above represent the truth sets of predicates $P(x)$ and $Q(x),$ defined over the universal set ${R}^{2}.$ Which of the following is the truth set of $P(x)⇔Q(x)?$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363755 1072 #uuid "96ab9b12-c6bc-56bd-aeba-ea72894263c3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363755 1074 "Since we have that \n\n$$\nP(x)⇔Q(x)≡(P(x)∧Q(x))∨(¬P(x)∧¬Q(x)),\n$$\n\n \n\nthe corresponding truth set can be found as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P⇔Q}=({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we sketch the set ${T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q}:$\n\n![](images/e9/e995ce9652d431c39c7a629a5e825c91fcdb2da56b83ad371c6bb319bc548eb9.png)\n\nThen, we sketch the set ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}$ and ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}:$\n\n![](images/fa/fa491500bff1c1e9d0f8453552f33b8deed066e3799a36817d039fc625eee47d.png)\n\nAs a result, ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}$ is the following: \n\n![](images/fb/fbcbb5ebd87fef90163ce5a358beb7bc40b4c4b3d91b89684500577ccedf2b13.png)\n\nFinally, to get the truth set of $P(x)⇔Q(x),$ we take all the points that belong to ${T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q}$ or ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}:$\n\n![](images/01/01776646145493da01e17a764ee1b71161595bcc249f376fc18cd9325a8218e7.png)" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363757 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363758 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363759 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363760 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363761 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363757 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363756 1080 #uuid "3f00ecb4-5a2c-5bd4-86e6-6fc0f7553e8b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363757 1081 "images/01/01776646145493da01e17a764ee1b71161595bcc249f376fc18cd9325a8218e7.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363757 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363757 1084 #uuid "95fc19e3-8ca8-5969-9f04-b5b491957e37" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363758 1081 "images/e4/e43b58f0eb6ca96a0d9849b75b3d72e3100671405ebe6196588cc482acd2cb9d.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363758 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363758 1084 #uuid "86cdb6bc-b584-57f3-9dbb-3aaf9f6680e4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363759 1081 "images/c8/c8b297d8b299fd2ed1c6e82fc8513de2cf30f4b4ad148e4c15d53941c7c40d62.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363759 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363759 1084 #uuid "af129731-17cf-5410-9081-c5e4ee3cd395" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363760 1081 "images/b8/b879f723061d5565f47bc076a85ab43a91f6981e867d2339061339a771f5043d.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363760 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363760 1084 #uuid "daa7f005-3d69-5915-b55a-e2ecdf47ba3b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363761 1081 "images/d2/d241c79ec2ab5c8ddc6cc4d1cf33f3355a91c44b30661afcf90e39e1b8ff6969.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363761 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363761 1084 #uuid "a3f2c811-72b8-53eb-915c-67d6bafee544" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363762 1068 #edb