^{+},$ and\n\n- the truth set of \"${y}^{2}<0$\" is $∅.$\n\nSo, the truth set of our predicate is \n\n$$\n{T}_{P}={R}_{0}^{+}\\cap ∅=∅.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each of the given statements.\n\n- Statement I is true. The truth set is empty.\n\n- Statement II is false. Indeed, ${T}_{P}\\ne {R}_{0}^{+}.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since ${T}_{P}$ does *not* coincide with the universal set, the statement $∀y\\in R,\\,P(y)$ is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363785 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363786 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363787 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363788 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363789 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363786 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363784 1080 #uuid "3aacbb1a-6cc8-56de-a3cf-e8097ea08557" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363785 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363785 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363785 1084 #uuid "e8ae1369-b7ee-5c00-a777-3fe6f0aa3a0d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363786 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363786 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363786 1084 #uuid "6b391104-ba09-582c-a764-3db08a687474" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363787 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363787 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363787 1084 #uuid "0b8606e8-2d30-5d6c-bbb3-aa8426a3b2c2" 1319