antifier $∀$ that uses $z:$\n\n$$\n(\\,∃y\\in (0,1),\\,xy=1\\,)⇒(\\,∀z\\in (1,2),\\,\\overset{\\text{scope of }∀z}{\\overset{⏞}{x{z}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}>3}})\n$$\n\n \n\nThe occurrences of variables in the expression are as follows:\n\n$$\n(\\,∃{y}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}\\in (0,1),\\,{x}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{f}\\end{aligned}}{y}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}=1\\,)⇒(\\,∀{z}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}\\in (1,2),\\,{x}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{f}\\end{aligned}}{z}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}>3\\,)\n$$\n\nTherefore, the free occurrence is \"I only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363897 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363898 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363899 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363900 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363901 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363898 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363896 1080 #uuid "d8ab54ab-c195-536b-a3d2-47150a0c3493" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363897 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363897 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363897 1084 #uuid "7ea5100c-a64f-53fe-8a32-7f0c9edf9359" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363898 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363898 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363898 1084 #uuid "dc71ecf3-7dc5-5acd-a148-7adeea3c24dd" 13194139533445 17592186045