$ treating all other variables as constants. \n\nUsing the constant multiple and chain rules, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{y}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(z\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(xy)) \\\\  & =z\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(xy)) \\\\  & =z\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(xy)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(xy) \\\\  & =z\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(xy)^{2}}}\\cdot (x) \\\\  & =\\frac{xz}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}{y}^{2}}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363988 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363989 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363990 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363991 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363992 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363988 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363987 1080 #uuid "0585b134-bc39-5ad2-9671-a9693974496c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363988 1081 "\\frac{xz}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363988 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363988 1084 #uuid "d7c02e33-edf5-5e9a-9dd7-81cb55213e16" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363989 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363989 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363989 1084 #uuid "2603ddd8-ff44-5138-990c-fd4a215965d6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363990 1081 "\\frac{z}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363990 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363990 1084 #uuid "48cc0f63-6ffb-5e32-995f-dc1c121b