rac{(17/4)}{(x+1/4)} \\\\  & =9-\\frac{17}{4x+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{9x-2}{4x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(9-\\frac{17}{4x+1})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[9{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\text{d}x-17{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{4x+1}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{[9x-\\frac{17}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|4x+1|]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[9(1-0)-\\frac{17}{4}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|5|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1|)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[9-\\frac{17\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{4}] \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}-\\frac{17}{16}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364001 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364000 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364000 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364000 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364001 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364000 1080 #uuid "2c34600f-4fd8-5eae-8163-8b4c103abbb6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364001 1081 "\\frac{9}{4}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364001 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364001 1084 #uuid "71554aa8-ba49-5cac-946e-97d864060d97" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364002 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364003 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364002 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364002 1077 "field-2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364002 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364003 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364002 1080 #uuid "05b41036-0ee2-5de3-9b82-b688d25c899a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364003 1081 "5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364003 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364003 1084 #uuid "919e5422-eb1b-5c10-92dc-898a0e2a4ba2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364004 1068 