{x}\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}[{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}^{3}{e}^{2y}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}{[\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2y}]}_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}^{3}dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(\\frac{{e}^{6}}{x}-\\frac{{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}}{x})dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(\\frac{{e}^{6}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{x})dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(\\frac{{e}^{6}}{x}-x)dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(\\frac{{e}^{6}}{x}-x)dx & =\\frac{1}{2}{[{e}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(({e}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)-\\frac{25}{2})-({e}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)-\\frac{1}{2})) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}-6\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364130 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364131 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364132 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364133 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364134 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364132 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364129 1080 #uuid "649d35e2-2a06-5b6a-9241-32e7a1eee0a4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364130 1081 "\\frac{{e}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}-12" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364130 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364130 1084 #uuid "42ce23ac-cf04-5deb-82d4-95fecac35215" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364131 1081 "{e}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364131 1083 #edb/ref 