{2}{e}^{xyz}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{yyx}(x,y,z)$ by differentiating ${f}_{yy}(x,y,z)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yyx}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{yy}(x,y,z)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}{z}^{2}{e}^{xyz}) \\\\  & ={z}^{2}\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}{e}^{xyz}) \\\\  & ={z}^{2}[2x\\cdot {e}^{xyz}+{x}^{2}{e}^{xyz}\\cdot yz] \\\\  & =x{z}^{2}(2+xyz){e}^{xyz}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we evaluate ${f}_{yyx}(x,y,z)$ at $(1,0,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yyx}(1,0,1) & =1\\cdot {1}^{2}\\cdot (2+1\\cdot 0\\cdot 1)\\cdot {e}^{1\\cdot 0\\cdot 1}=1\\cdot (2+0)\\cdot {e}^{0}=2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364202 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364203 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364204 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364205 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364206 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364203 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1080 #uuid "bfdf4083-7c0d-5adf-a34c-a58b71b6a55a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364202 1081 "3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364202 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364202 1084 #uuid "c2923372-2d0a-59b2-8fef-02b8d7fb6386" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364203 1081 "2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364203 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364203 1084 #uuid "71dda3a3-965f-55af-ba3c-60d278468eec" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364204 1081 "4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364204 1083 #edb/ref 17592186