st, we use the sum and constant multiple rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x{z}^{3}-{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x{z}^{3})-\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi y)) \\\\  & ={z}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(x)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi y)\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}) \\\\  & ={z}^{3}\\cdot 1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi y)\\cdot 2x \\\\  & ={z}^{3}-2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,1,2):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}{|}_{(1,1,2)} & ={2}^{3}-2(1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi (1)) \\\\  & =8-2(1)(-1) \\\\  & =8+2 \\\\  & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364223 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364224 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364225 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364226 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364227 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364223 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364222 1080 #uuid "524bf164-94aa-5c0e-a84e-da7f0acbfdd0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364223 1081 "10" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364223 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364223 1084 #uuid "ac4949ac-c2c5-5400-9b81-caf9da897244" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364224 1081 "8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364224 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364224 1084 #uuid "ecb86e61-8965-50a0-9c65-7710e3f23e54" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364225 1081 "2" 13194139533445 17592