 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364253 1084 #uuid "673419a3-24e0-51e3-9611-2beffc23734f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364254 1081 "{e}^{2}-2e+1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364254 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364254 1084 #uuid "fbbc9829-eb5a-5959-a476-9f50812cf99b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364256 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1069 "q-71999" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1071 "Given that $f(x,y)=\\frac{\\sqrt{x+y}}{y},$ find the set of values $(x,y)$ on which $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}$ exists." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1072 #uuid "085f5bf8-fd9d-5a03-95fc-bd2093188160" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364255 1074 "First, notice that $f(x,y)$ is defined only when \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y & \\ge 0\\,\\text{and}\\,y\\ne 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the domain of $f$ is \n\n$$\n{D}_{f}={(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y\\ge 0}.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the partial derivative of $f(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{\\sqrt{x+y}}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{y\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x+y}}-\\sqrt{x+y}}{{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{y-2x-2y}{2{y}^{2}\\sqrt{x+y}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2x-y}{2{y}^{2}\\sqrt{x+y}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ is defined only for \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y>0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n So, the domain of ${f}_{y}$ is\n\n$$\n{D}_{{f}_{y}}={(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y>0}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we conclude that the partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ exists on the set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{f}\\cap {D}_{{f}_{y}} & ={(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y\\ge 0}\\cap {(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y>0} \\\\  & ={(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y>0}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364257 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364258 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364259 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364260 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364261 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364259 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364256 1080 #uuid "7e5cd076-93d9-5103-82f2-702cb556fcbd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364257 1081 "${f}_{y}$ exists everywhere on the $xy$-plane" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364257 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364257 1084 #uuid "c2bb0473-f9ad-5af8-a6db-3dea346a4532" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364258 1081 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,x+y>0}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364258 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364258 1084 #uuid "d58fbc2c-af09-542b-bc8e-6714ec6ba01d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364259 1081 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x+y>0}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364259 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364259 1084 #uuid "7d6bf742-c78b-56d1-b4c5-708cd0cb7120" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364260 1081 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\,x\\ne 0}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364260 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364260 1084 #uuid "d202753f-b682-5081-aa71-285197acf490" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364261 1081 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\ne 0\\,\\text{and}\\