ext{d}y]\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364306 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364307 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364308 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364309 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364310 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364306 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364305 1080 #uuid "0622cd69-4c51-5518-8cd5-e19cc8bb61df" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364306 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364306 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364306 1084 #uuid "36eb381d-984c-5c7c-8695-13a228ebc66f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364307 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364307 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364307 1084 #uuid "9cdf14fd-bd62-5b79-bb80-c6d71e222e01" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364308 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364308 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364308 1084 #uuid "5107a618-1189-5062-bf19-d3bedfbafccd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364309 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364309 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364309 1084 #uuid "cf0c9dae-9f5c-577b-bb7d-c1e0c1afe94b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364310 1081 "II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364310 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364310 1084 #uuid "7dfc5c71-215b-5076-a792-d29b149f8786" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364312 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1069 "q-72266" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 2,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1072 #uuid "d63f493d-43c5-52a2-9f1e-5afe59523cca" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364311 1074 "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:        \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}[{\\int }_{-2}^{2}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}[{\\int }_{-2}^{2}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}9{y}^{2}[{\\int }_{-2}^{2}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}9{y}^{2}{[\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{-2}^{2}\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}9{y}^{2}(\\frac{{2}^{3}}{3}-\\frac{(-2)^{3}}{3})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}9{y}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{16}{3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}48{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}48{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y & =[16{y}^{3}]_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =16({1}^{3}-(-1)^{3}) \\\\  & =16\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =32\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364313 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364314 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364315 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364316 131941