rue] [17592186364339 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364339 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 3,\\,-3\\le y\\le -1}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364339 1072 #uuid "6487b6b9-d5be-5e16-b654-46f92252f451" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364339 1074 "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:      \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{-3}^{-1}[{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{-1}[{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{-3}^{3}\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}[{\\int }_{0}^{3}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}{[\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{0}^{3}\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}(\\frac{{3}^{3}}{3}-\\frac{{0}^{3}}{3})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3}^{-1}\\frac{9}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{-1}\\frac{9}{{y}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}y & =9{[-\\frac{1}{2{y}^{2}}]}_{-3}^{-1} \\\\  & =9(-\\frac{1}{2(-1)^{2}}+\\frac{1}{2(-3)^{2}}) \\\\  & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364341 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364342 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364343 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364344 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364345 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364340 1077 "selecti