egral by integrating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant:    \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{{5}^{y}}{x}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{5}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}{[\\frac{{5}^{y}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}(\\frac{{5}^{1}-{5}^{0}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{x}(\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡x]_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1) \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364348 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364349 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364350 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364351 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364352 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364352 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364347 1080 #uuid "a2b26e7d-3c4d-554d-aa2d-1a49ff85dcf7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364348 1081 "\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364348 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364348 1084 #uuid "28ceb7de-9662-54a6-80d2-2950c854cfca" 13194139533445 175921860