tegral is independent of $x.$ So, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}y\\text{ }\\text{d}A & =(2-1){\\int }_{0}^{8}y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}{|}_{0}^{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{{8}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2} \\\\  & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, combining our results, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\frac{1+y{x}^{3}}{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}A=3+32=35.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364478 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364479 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364480 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364481 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364482 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364479 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364477 1080 #uuid "dc0d3863-9fe2-5bb6-8578-90c9d149b878" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364478 1081 "25" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364478 1084 #uuid "d8458ae4-fafc-5a98-ab45-1adea4f03cfb" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364479 1081 "35" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364479 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364479 1084 #uuid "9addff4c-74aa-5855-b730-fe68fa5f33b9" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364480 1081 "39" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364480 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364480 1084 #uuid "e32440d6-fac7-5caf-bfd7-7612653eb6a8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364481 1081 "31" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364481 1083 #edb/ref 1759