=24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe third integral is the double integral of unity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\text{d}A=\\text{Area}(R)=3\\cdot 4=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, combining our results, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}({x}^{2}-y+1)\\,\\text{d}A=36-24+12=24.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364519 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364520 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364521 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364522 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364523 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364523 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1080 #uuid "d2ffc185-1273-5e29-8ff4-7540cee84426" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364519 1081 "12" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364519 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364519 1084 #uuid "51a89715-7a54-5300-819b-fa080b061464" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364520 1081 "36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364520 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364520 1084 #uuid "56fb164e-39a3-5e17-815d-ec81eaeb5642" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364521 1081 "72" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364521 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364521 1084 #uuid "a9cb3d91-b5e5-5157-8a43-6dd0b3fbf045" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364522 1081 "0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364522 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364522 1084 #uuid "8cf0027f-33d6-5d