 & =-\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{1}+{e}^{1}-({e}^{2}+{e}^{0})) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2}-2e+1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364561 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364562 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364563 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364564 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364565 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364565 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364560 1080 #uuid "c47442ae-5527-5caf-9a94-06d41bf2c9e0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364561 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364561 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364561 1084 #uuid "564a011e-7d84-5afe-b400-660c22c62607" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364562 1081 "\\frac{1-{e}^{2}}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364562 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364562 1084 #uuid "9eeb7da5-02bc-53cd-8e9b-696b1ca81db9" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364563 1081 "{e}^{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364563 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364563 1084 #uuid "c88a38f3-dfb9-5885-a772-66802526c4bb" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364564 1081 "{e}^{2}-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364564 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364564 1084 #uuid "d4831a22-e864-59f2-ae77-cad6d38daf40" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364565 1081 "\\frac{{e}^{2}-2e+1}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364565 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364565 1084 #uuid "066b28e3-9cf3-5ff6-8a91-a6102f1fe87b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364567 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1069 "q-81485" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1071 "Which of the following statements are logically equivalent?\n\n- $¬(¬A∨¬B)$\n- $A∧B$\n- $A∨B$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1072 #uuid "c1094e86-e368-5edf-a0b9-d55c19636e6a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364566 1074 "Two statements are logically equivalent if they have the same truth table. So, we construct a truth table for the three given statements:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬(¬A∨¬B)\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ | $\\,A∨B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nWe see that only the statements $¬(¬A∨¬B)$ and $A∧B$ have the same truth table, so they are logically equivalent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364568 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364569 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364570 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364571 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364572 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364567 1079 #edb