2186364614 1071 "Let $X$ be the score obtained on the roll of a fair eight-sided die with sides labeled with numbers $1$ through $8.$ What is $\\text{SD}[X]?$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364614 1072 #uuid "e2101e2d-c6fd-5f92-9d3e-76d611379a69" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364614 1074 "The standard deviation of a random variable $X$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\text{SD}[X]=\\sqrt{\\text{Var}[X]},\n$$\n\nwhere the variance can be computed using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nFirst, we need to compute the probability mass function $f(x).$ Here, there are $8$ possible outcomes $(1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8)$ and each outcome has the same probability, so the probability mass function is as follows:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ | $7$ | $8$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ |\n\nNext, we compute $\\text{E}[X].$ Summing up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =1\\cdot f(1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(4)+5\\cdot f(5)+6\\cdot f(6)+7\\cdot f(7)+8\\cdot f(8) \\\\  & =1(\\frac{1}{8})+2(\\frac{1}{8})+3(\\frac{1}{8})+4(\\frac{1}{8})+5(\\frac{1}{8})+6(\\frac{1}{8})+7(\\frac{1}{8})+8(\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={1}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(2)+{3}^{2}\\cdot f(3)+{4}^{2}\\cdot f(4)+{5}^{2}\\cdot f(5)+{6}^{2}\\cdot f(6)+{7}^{2}\\cdot f(7)+{8}^{2}\\cdot f(8) \\\\  & =1(\\frac{1}{8})+4(\\frac{1}{8})+9(\\frac{1}{8})+16(\\frac{1}{8})+25(\\frac{1}{8})+36(\\frac{1}{8})+49(\\frac{1}{8})+64(\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{51}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{51}{2}-{(\\frac{9}{2})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{51}{2}-\\frac{81}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{21}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{SD}[X] & =\\sqrt{\\text{Var}[X]} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{21}{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364616 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364617 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364618 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364619 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364620 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364620 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364615 1080 #uuid "1f5a3ad6-5ebf-5d26-9d5a-a818ee43fb49" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364616 1081 "\\sqrt{\\frac{21}{2}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364616 1084 #uuid "574ef0a4-5362-5546-8528-72a3217d2aad" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364617 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{12}}{4}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364617 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364617 1084 #uuid "07b47daa-fc1f-5086-a20f-83e41511e01e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364618 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{12}}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364618 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364618 1084 #uuid "0a4cb418-f3f6-530a-ae36-923b8c194f50" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364619 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{4}" 131941