=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nwhich defines an empty set. Notice that the left-hand side is non-negative for all ${y}_{1}$ while the right-hand side is negative. In this case, we say that the equation represents a pair of imaginary parallel lines." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364685 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364686 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364687 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364688 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364689 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364687 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364684 1080 #uuid "5fafd403-1048-5486-bde0-474448fe8369" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364685 1081 "A hyperbola with semiaxes $1$ and $\\sqrt{2}$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364685 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364685 1084 #uuid "a53f3b40-d084-5d93-9e65-df2c2a1e2310" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364686 1081 "A circle of radius $1$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364686 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364686 1084 #uuid "d0416679-d7f1-58a8-9802-1f018174205e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364687 1081 "A pair of imaginary parallel lines" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364687 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364687 1084 #uuid "708a2267-b214-52b5-b66b-bc9e0e5ca6dc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364688 1081 "A single point" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364688 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 